---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service for Smart Home Improvements, including our SMS text messaging program terms."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-x max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold uppercase text-navy-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="prose-content mt-8">
        <p>
          These terms govern your use of {site.url} and your communications with Smart Home
          Improvements ("we," "us," or "our"), a licensed California contractor
          (CA License #{site.license}) serving {site.areaServed}.
        </p>

        <h2>Our services</h2>
        <p>
          Content on this website is provided for general information about our roofing, window,
          and insulation services. Estimates and inspections are free and carry no obligation.
          Project scope, pricing, and schedule are set only in a written agreement signed by both
          parties, not by anything on this website.
        </p>

        <h2>SMS text messaging terms</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit a form on our website or otherwise provide your mobile number, you
          consent to receive calls and text messages (SMS) from Smart Home Improvements about
          your inquiry, estimate, appointments, and related service updates, including messages
          sent through automated technology. Consent is not a condition of purchasing anything.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Message frequency varies</strong> based on your inquiry and project activity.</li>
          <li><strong>Message and data rates may apply</strong> according to your mobile plan.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt out anytime:</strong> reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to cancel. You may receive one final message confirming your opt out.</li>
          <li><strong>Need help?</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message, call <a href={`tel:${site.phoneRaw}`} class="text-navy-700 underline">{site.phone}</a>, or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-navy-700 underline">{site.email}</a>.</li>
          <li>Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
          <li>Your mobile information is handled as described in our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-navy-700 underline">Privacy Policy</a> and is never shared with third parties for their marketing purposes.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Website use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use this website lawfully and not to interfere with its operation. Site
          content, branding, and photography belong to Smart Home Improvements and may not be
          reused without permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          The website is provided as is, without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent
          permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from
          use of the website. Nothing here limits rights you have under California law or the
          terms of a signed service agreement.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. The date above reflects the latest
          revision, and continued use of the website means you accept the current version.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Reach us at {site.email} or {site.phone}. Smart Home
          Improvements, {site.city}, {site.region}. CA License #{site.license}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
